{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 20, "text": "// Tutorial"}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 21, "text": "Wait, what am I doing over here?"}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 22, "text": "I need to get to your screen..."}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 23, "text": "Hold on..."}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 24, "text": "So!"}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 25, "text": "You need to make sure that it's a suitable prototype."}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 26, "text": "Scan the prototype first."}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 27, "text": "Now, let's compare the version and bone quantity."}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 28, "text": "Take this prototype's data film and compare it to the standard."}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 29, "text": "It's a perfect match! Now, let's check its emotions."}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 30, "text": "The specimen displays the correct emotions! Time to test its behavior."}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 31, "text": "Okay, we've checked everything, and it's all good! Now pull the lever up."}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 32, "text": "Yay! Now her skin is on! Pass her the box of clothes."}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 33, "text": "That's it! See those lights on top? One of them turned green, which means we did it right!"}
{"category": "MiniGame MakeManeken", "line_index": 34, "text": "I'll leave the rest to you. I'll be back when all the lights turn green. Good luck!"}
